270
00:11:46,164 --> 00:11:47,748
As I was saying,

271
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:51,336
I'm Dr. Ross Geller

272
00:11:51,378 --> 00:11:54,047
uh, and I'm the best man

273
00:11:54,088 --> 00:11:55,882
