289
00:12:42,136 --> 00:12:43,221
Nobody wants to do it?

290
00:12:43,263 --> 00:12:44,681
All right, I'll do it myself.

291
00:12:44,723 --> 00:12:47,642
Monica, I'm not
going to screw it up.

292
00:12:47,684 --> 00:12:49,394
You know what?
You're right, I'm sorry.

293
00:12:49,436 --> 00:12:51,563
Actually,
you were a big help tonight.

294
00:12:51,605 --> 00:12:53,398
Yeah, and thanks for putting
my grandmother in the cab

295
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,316
and making sure
she got to the hotel safely.

296
00:12:55,358 --> 00:12:57,818
Well, of course,
that is what I'm here for.

297
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:59,362
Okay, sorry.

298
00:12:59,404 --> 00:13:01,322
Oh...

299
00:13:01,364 --> 00:13:03,116
What grandmother?

300
00:13:07,287 --> 00:13:09,038
Hey, where have you been?

301
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,207
