back to work?

303
00:13:12,292 --> 00:13:13,334
Yeah.

304
00:13:13,376 --> 00:13:14,711
Nice shades.

305
00:13:14,753 --> 00:13:17,130
Thanks, I figure if
I wear these in my scenes

306
00:13:17,171 --> 00:13:20,508
at least I won't get spit
in my eyes, you know?

307
00:13:20,550 --> 00:13:22,093
And, if I remember correctly

308
00:13:22,135 --> 00:13:25,096
Ray-Ban was the official
sponsor of World War I.

309
00:13:26,556 --> 00:13:27,515
Great!

310
00:13:27,557 --> 00:13:29,601
All right.

311
00:13:29,643 --> 00:13:31,519
I'll see you later.
All right.

312
00:13:31,561 --> 00:13:33,104
Hey, where's Chandler?

313
00:13:33,146 --> 00:13:35,106
I think he's in Rachel's room.
See you.

314
00:13:36,483 --> 00:13:37,484
Chandler.

315
00:13:42,489 --> 00:13:44,282
Chandler?

316
