328
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:34,624
Oh, my God.

329
00:14:34,666 --> 00:14:36,501
Chandler just
left though?

330
00:14:36,543 --> 00:14:38,002
Yeah, but maybe
it's not what we think.

331
00:14:38,044 --> 00:14:41,088
Maybe it's...
"Tell Monica I'm sorry...

332
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:43,508
