two pages.

354
00:15:42,149 --> 00:15:43,526
All right.

355
00:15:47,739 --> 00:15:51,033
I found the picture.

356
00:15:51,075 --> 00:15:52,786
The picture?
What picture?

357
00:15:52,827 --> 00:15:56,080
