all over me, man.

365
00:16:15,809 --> 00:16:17,685
Well, of course I am.

366
00:16:17,727 --> 00:16:20,229
You know you've
been spitting on me?

367
00:16:20,271 --> 00:16:23,399
That's what real
actors do.

368
00:16:23,441 --> 00:16:26,778
Enunciation is the mark
of a good actor.

369
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:29,405
And when you
enunciate... you spit.

370
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:34,953
Wow. Didn't know that.

371
00:16:34,993 --> 00:16:35,954
Thanks.

372
00:16:35,995 --> 00:16:37,580
Okay, okay, check it out.

373
00:16:38,665 --> 00:16:41,626
Picture? What picture?

374
00:16:41,668 --> 00:16:42,585
( spits )

375
00:16:45,463 --> 00:16:47,089
Huh?

376
00:16:50,927 --> 00:16:53,012
Gunther, have you, uh,
have you seen Chandler?

377
00:16:53,053 --> 00:16:54,472
No, no, I haven't seen him.

378
00:16:54,514 --> 00:16:55,890
Oh, damn.

379
00:16:55,932 --> 00:16:57,767
