Well, then, we'll see you
the day after tomorrow.

384
00:17:12,198 --> 00:17:14,032
Mom? Dad?

385
00:17:14,074 --> 00:17:16,243
Wha-what are you guys
doing here?

386
00:17:16,285 --> 00:17:18,037
Well, you kids talk
about this place so much

387
00:17:18,078 --> 00:17:20,331
