395
00:17:41,227 --> 00:17:44,022
No, no, I know,
I know what the list is.

396
00:17:44,062 --> 00:17:46,816
Come on, sit down,
have a cup of joe.

397
00:17:48,401 --> 00:17:50,152
Dad, I can't. I'm sorry.

398
00:17:50,194 --> 00:17:52,154
Look, if you see Chandler

399
00:17:52,196 --> 00:17:54,240
