411
00:18:36,365 --> 00:18:39,410
Cut. Wonderful.

412
00:18:41,245 --> 00:18:43,163
Great scene, huh?

413
00:18:43,205 --> 00:18:45,083
You were awesome, man.
And that last speech,

414
00:18:45,124 --> 00:18:46,292
