Stop it, stop it, Rachel.
You can't do this here.

439
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:56,904
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

440
00:19:56,946 --> 00:19:59,365
It's just...
it's just so sad.

441
00:19:59,406 --> 00:20:01,117
