if Chandler doesn't show up.

458
00:20:42,992 --> 00:20:44,535
Oh, here's a whole bunch.

459
00:20:44,577 --> 00:20:46,286
I mean, she's going
to be at the wedding

460
00:20:46,328 --> 00:20:47,287
