470
00:21:07,016 --> 00:21:09,227
So I guess she won't
be totally alone.

471
00:21:16,192 --> 00:21:17,693
Next time on Friends...

472
00:21:17,735 --> 00:21:18,694
We've got to tell
her that he's gone.

473
00:21:18,736 --> 00:21:20,446
No! Hey, hey, we can't!

474
00:21:20,487 --> 00:21:22,281
She's going to start
getting ready soon.

475
00:21:22,322 --> 00:21:24,491
Can't you at least
stall her a little?

476
00:21:24,533 --> 00:21:26,744
I'm never gonna
get married!

477
00:21:28,246 --> 00:21:29,622
We've just got
one short scene

478
00:21:29,663 --> 00:21:31,249
it's just you
and Richard

479
00:21:31,290 --> 00:21:34,001
and, God knows,
he's a pro.

480
00:21:34,043 --> 00:21:35,128
