No!

482
00:21:36,212 --> 00:21:37,421
Yes, you are.

483
00:21:37,463 --> 00:21:40,258
All right.

484
00:21:40,299 --> 00:21:42,301
Hey, how's Chandler doing?
Great.

485
00:21:42,342 --> 00:21:44,053
Where are you?
I'm still on the set.

486
00:21:44,095 --> 00:21:46,346
This is turning into
the worst wedding day ever.

